Searching for AV cable management mostly turns up cable tie manufacturers and fabrication shops selling hardware, not an answer to the actual question behind the search: what happens to the cables at your own event. Four of our five packages already list "aesthetic cabling" or a close variant as a standard inclusion, a phrase that has sat in our own catalog for a long time without ever being explained on this site, until now.

This page is that explanation: what actually happens to cables at a Malaga Event Gear booking, why it matters for safety and for your photos, how far a cable run can realistically go, and, just as honestly, what we do not do.

[Contact us](/contact/) with your venue details if a specific run length or a difficult site is part of your planning.

